      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "(You broke me first, ah)",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Maybe you don't like talkin' too much about yourself",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "But you shoulda told me that you were thinkin' 'bout someone else",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "You're drunk at a party or maybe it's just that your car broke down",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Your phone's been off for a couple months, so you're callin' me now",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "pre-chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I know you, you're like this",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "When shit don't go your way, you needed me to fix it",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "And like me, I did",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "But I ran out of every reason",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_3",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Now suddenly, you're askin' for it back",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Could you tell me, where'd you get the nerve?",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Yeah, you could say you miss all that we had",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "But I don't really care how bad it hurts",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "When you broke me first",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "You broke me first",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_4",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Took a while, was in denial when I first heard",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "That you moved on quicker than I coulda ever, you know that hurt",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Swear for a while, I would stare at my phone just to see your name",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "But now that it's there, I don't really know what to say",
          "persona_id": "persona_tate_baseline"
        }
      ]
    },
